he line $y=5qx+9$ is $5q.$\n\n- The slope of the line $y=-3x-8$ is $-3.$\n\nMultiplying the slopes together, we have\n\n$$\n5q\\cdot (-3)=-1\\,⟹\\,q=\\frac{1}{15}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-28328/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "6f3d7d62-686b-59c4-9ea1-695c6be3180b"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-28328"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-215939/field-1/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133" :answer/id #uuid "5d252f6a-a6ed-5b6f-839d-8757f218ea91" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-215939/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "3fe24769-facb-561b-8907-799770c5d13a" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-215939/field-1/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133" :answer-field/choices ["q-215939/field-1/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-215939" :question/id #uuid "2b789b4e-b370-5ab0-ad38-332e88544678" :question/math-academy-id "q-215939" :question/is-example false :question/problem "The lines $y=2x+1$ and $kx-10y=3$ are perpendicular. What is the value of $k?$\n\n$k=$\n\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "For the two lines to be perpendicular, their slopes must multiply to $-1.$\n\n- The first line is in slope-intercept form, and the slope is the $x$-coefficient. So the slope of the line $y=2x+1$ is $2.$\n\n- To find the slope of $kx-10y=3,$ we convert to slope-intercept form:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}kx-10y & =3 \\\\ 10y & =kx-3 \\\\ y & =\\frac{k}{10}x-\\frac{3}{10}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope of the line $kx-10y=3$ is $\\frac{k}{10}.$\n\nMultiplying the slopes together, we have\n\n$$\n2\\cdot (\\frac{k}{10})=-1\\,⟹\\,k=-5.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-215939/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "6f3d7d62-686b-59c4-9ea1-695c6be3180b"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-215939"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-110142/selection/264ed6922279f92bdc90c36a26ea47de8f6c6ab903ed9e63c8b8bb51a5a9d4f6" :answer/id #uuid "c6c42920-e9fc-5532-9aa3-7ecd9554446c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110142/selection/3156fa3aa006e591d496860456be38662b872375433bbcf5b2f4cb01e08eaa8b" :answer/id #uuid "0c816aa5-43d9-50c5-8f35-33ad3040ae11" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110142/selection/feb2c353acce484cb267fc95bae1ab6db185f770de87fe9eb4e168b5aa1d3a8e" :answer/id #uuid "47fb6175-b717-58fd-9de0-011f80755ead" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=\\frac{1}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110142/selection/cb1896197a67f182a612a87dbfdf77a8994e499a7df0036f929b0112dee816e0" :answer/id #uuid "35ce6038-44b2-541f-9932-6ac3539b5ccf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110142/selection/162100556374eceee000bc751d8bdc1ebe6e5f9373418df766066cd9a8f7eb4d" :answer/id #uuid "3c82e392-e55c-5344-9386-dcfb535ac7bf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110142/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "a28909b0-a1f7-5304-a153-c6ff2f09b951" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-110142/selection/cb1896197a67f182a612a87dbfdf77a8994e499a7df0036f929b0112dee816e0" :answer-field/choices ["q-110142/selection/264ed6922279f92bdc90c36a26ea47de8f6c6ab903ed9e63c8b8bb51a5a9d4f6" "q-110142/selection/3156fa3aa006e591d496860456be38662b872375433bbcf5b2f4cb01e08eaa8b" "q-110142/selection/feb2c353acce484cb267fc95bae1ab6db185f770de87fe9eb4e168b5aa1d3a8e" "q-110142/selection/cb1896197a67f182a612a87dbfdf77a8994e499a